flowchart TD
    Email[Email provider failure] --> Guardian[Circuit Guardian counts failures]
    Guardian --> Open{Three failures?}
    Open -- No --> Retry[Backoff retry]
    Open -- Yes --> CircuitOpen[Open circuit]
    CircuitOpen --> Durable[Keep job in database]
    Durable --> Sweep[Self-heal sweep]
    Sweep --> Retry
    Retry --> Limit{Five attempts?}
    Limit -- No --> Send[Try provider]
    Limit -- Yes --> DLQ[Dead letter with error]
    Send --> Success{Success?}
    Success -- Yes --> Closed[Mark sent and close circuit]
    Success -- No --> Guardian
